# The symbols example's entry module. It builds the tree for `(1 + 2) * x` in a
# node list, defines `x` and `y` in a symbol table, evaluates the tree, defines
# `x` again and evaluates it once more, counts the number nodes, and lists the
# symbol table.
#
# What the checker and runtime guarantee here (docs/safety-guarantees.md):
# - Nodes refer to each other by `NodeId`, a position in `nodes` (D-60). A
#   position has no literal: each one comes from `appendIndexed`, and reading
#   a position the list does not have is an error, not a stray read.
# - `evaluate` calls itself at most 64 deep (`maxRecursion 64`); deeper traps.
# - The symbol table copies each new name into `store` (D-61), so the names
#   the listing reads stay valid as long as the table.
# - The listing reads the table in first-definition order (D-62); it may not
#   change the table while it reads it, and it states its bound, the table's
#   length, which it reads first.
# - Every allocation goes into `store`; passing its 65536 bytes traps.
#
# Prints 15, then 30, then 2, then each name and its value: x, 10, y, 7.
# Exit codes: 0 done, 2 a name has no value, 3 a node is missing, 5 standard
# output failed.

symbols is module
symbols purpose "Build and evaluate one expression tree against a symbol table and print what it finds"
symbols path symbols
symbols imports standard.console
symbols imports standard.map
symbols imports expressions
symbols exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

main is operation
main purpose "Build the tree for (1 + 2) * x, evaluate it under two values of x, and list the symbol table"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label printFirst loopKind none
main label printFirst within none
main label redefine loopKind none
main label redefine within none
main label printSecond loopKind none
main label printSecond within none
main label count loopKind none
main label count within none
main label showNames note "The table's size is known only at run time, so the bound is its length, read before the loop"
main label showNames loopKind forEach
main label showNames within none
main label showNames maxIterations nameCount
main label showNames over symbolTable
main label showName loopKind none
main label showName within showNames
main label showValue loopKind none
main label showValue within showNames
main label printValue loopKind none
main label printValue within showNames
main label finished loopKind none
main label finished within none
main label firstFailed loopKind none
main label firstFailed within none
main label secondFailed loopKind none
main label secondFailed within none
main label noName loopKind none
main label noName within none
main label noNode loopKind none
main label noNode within none
main label outputFailed loopKind none
main label outputFailed within none
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let two Int64 2 immutable
main let five Int64 5 immutable
main let seven Int64 7 immutable
main let ten Int64 10 immutable
main let xInTree String "x" immutable
main let xName String "x" immutable
main let yName String "y" immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let noNameCode ExitCode 2 immutable
main let noNodeCode ExitCode 3 immutable
main let outputCode ExitCode 5 immutable
main at begin do makeNodes
main at begin do makeSymbols
main at begin do addOne
main at begin do addTwo
main at begin do addOnePlusTwo
main at begin do addX
main at begin do addRoot
main at begin do defineX
main at begin do defineY
main at begin do evaluateFirst
main at begin branch ifError evaluateFirst goto firstFailed else goto printFirst
main at printFirst do printFirstValue
main at printFirst branch ifError printFirstValue goto outputFailed else goto redefine
main at redefine do redefineX
main at redefine do evaluateSecond
main at redefine branch ifError evaluateSecond goto secondFailed else goto printSecond
main at printSecond do printSecondValue
main at printSecond branch ifError printSecondValue goto outputFailed else goto count
main at count do countThem
main at count do measureTable
main at count do printCount
main at count branch ifError printCount goto outputFailed else goto showNames
main at showNames branch ifNext symbolTable bind name String goto showName else goto finished
main at showName do printName
main at showName branch ifError printName goto outputFailed else goto showValue
main at showValue do readValue
main at showValue branch ifError readValue goto noName else goto printValue
main at printValue do printValueLine
main at printValue branch ifError printValueLine goto outputFailed else goto showNames
main at finished return ok okCode
main at firstFailed match firstError expressions.EvalError
main at firstFailed case expressions.EvalError.unknownName bind none none goto noName
main at firstFailed case expressions.EvalError.missingNode bind firstPosition Int64 goto noNode
main at secondFailed match secondError expressions.EvalError
main at secondFailed case expressions.EvalError.unknownName bind none none goto noName
main at secondFailed case expressions.EvalError.missingNode bind secondPosition Int64 goto noNode
main at noName return ok noNameCode
main at noNode return ok noNodeCode
main at outputFailed return ok outputCode

store is region
store in main
store strategy arena
store maxBytes 65536
store released atReturn

makeNodes is call
makeNodes in main
makeNodes invokes expressions.Nodes.new
makeNodes argument region Region store lend
makeNodes result nodes expressions.Nodes
makeNodes ownedBy store
makeNodes cleanedBy none
makeNodes borrows none
makeNodes catch none

makeSymbols is call
makeSymbols in main
makeSymbols invokes expressions.Symbols.new
makeSymbols argument region Region store lend
makeSymbols result symbolTable expressions.Symbols
makeSymbols ownedBy store
makeSymbols cleanedBy none
makeSymbols borrows none
makeSymbols catch none

